         How to set up:
         1. Copy this file to:
            - android/app/src/debug/res/values/strings.xml
            - android/app/src/release/res/values/strings.xml
         2. Replace YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE with your real key
         3. Keep android/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml in .gitignore
         4. The placeholder below is safe to commit
    -->
    <string name="app_name">kaistable</string>
